---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="联系"><section class="shell py-20 md:py-28"><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><div class="mt-6 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1fr_.7fr]"><h1 class="section-title">想法、问题，<br/>都值得聊聊。</h1><div class="border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--panel)] p-7"><p class="muted">项目尚未配置正式的支持邮箱。你可以暂时通过当前代码仓库提交 Issue，反馈产品问题、平台兼容性或合作建议。</p><a href="https://github.com/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary mt-7">前往 GitHub</a><p class="muted mt-5 text-xs">正式发布前将替换为实际仓库与支持地址。</p></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
